    {
      "subId": "1501808",
      "subQuestName": "与瓦雷莎交谈",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "150180101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "150180101": {
            "id": "150180101",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "这个立在路边的木板是干什么用的？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150180107"
            ]
          },
          "150180107": {
            "id": "150180107",
            "speakerId": 1098,
            "speakerName": "瓦雷莎",
            "text": "哦，这是我们部族的健身器材，我也经常用。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150180108"
            ]
          },
          "150180108": {
            "id": "150180108",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "健身器材？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150180109"
            ]
          },
          "150180109": {
            "id": "150180109",
            "speakerId": 1098,
            "speakerName": "瓦雷莎",
            "text": "嗯，我想想…比起解释还是直接演示一下更快。瓦雷莎，要上了——",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150180103"
            ]
          },
          "150180103": {
            "id": "150180103",
            "speakerId": 1098,
            "speakerName": "瓦雷莎",
            "text": "平稳落地！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150180104"
            ]
          },
          "150180104": {
            "id": "150180104",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "呜哇啊啊，就这么跳过去了，你好厉害啊！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150180105"
            ]
          },
          "150180105": {
            "id": "150180105",
            "speakerId": 1098,
            "speakerName": "瓦雷莎",
            "text": "没什么，没什么，只要多加练习，很多人都可以做得到。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150180110"
            ]
          },
          "150180110": {
            "id": "150180110",
            "speakerId": 1098,
            "speakerName": "瓦雷莎",
            "text": "哦！你甚至都不需要训练，直接飞过来就好，这不是比我厉害多了嘛。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150180112"
            ]
          },
          "150180112": {
            "id": "150180112",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "这不一样啦…嗯，但你说的有道理！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1501805",
      "subQuestName": "沿道路前进",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "150180501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "150180501": {
            "id": "150180501",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "#我是派蒙，{M#他}{F#她}叫{NICKNAME}，我们是最好的伙伴。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150180502"
            ]
          },
          "150180502": {
            "id": "150180502",
            "speakerId": 1098,
            "speakerName": "瓦雷莎",
            "text": "#好的，派蒙和{NICKNAME}，真是不错的名字，我记住了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150180503"
            ]
          },
          "150180503": {
            "id": "150180503",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "那我们这就出发吧！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1501803",
      "subQuestName": "沿道路继续前进",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "150180301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "150180301": {
            "id": "150180301",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "你好，请问…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150180303"
            ]
          },
          "150180303": {
            "id": "150180303",
            "speakerId": 10205,
            "speakerName": "？？？",
            "text": "嗯？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150180304"
            ]
          },
          "150180304": {
            "id": "150180304",
            "speakerId": 10205,
            "speakerName": "？？？",
            "text": "你们是不是迷路了？需要我帮忙吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150180305"
            ]
          },
          "150180305": {
            "id": "150180305",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "没有没有，我们只是正巧路过这里，想去「沃陆之邦」看看…请问是往这个方向去吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150180306"
            ]
          },
          "150180306": {
            "id": "150180306",
            "speakerId": 10205,
            "speakerName": "？？？",
            "text": "没错，那里是我的家，如果需要的话，现在我就能带你们过去。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150180307"
            ]
          },
          "150180307": {
            "id": "150180307",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "#太好了，{NICKNAME}，又遇到了当地的向导！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150180308"
            ]
          },
          "150180308": {
            "id": "150180308",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "你想偷懒的语气太明显了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150180309"
            ]
          },
          "150180309": {
            "id": "150180309",
            "speakerId": 10205,
            "speakerName": "？？？",
            "text": "向导啊…我应该没问题吧，嘿嘿，那我现在就是你们的向导。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150180310"
            ]
          },
          "150180310": {
            "id": "150180310",
            "speakerId": 10205,
            "speakerName": "？？？",
            "text": "这一路上有很多特别的风景，我可以帮你们介绍，几乎每个刚来我们这里的人，都会发出「哇哦——」的感叹呢。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150180311"
            ]
          },
          "150180311": {
            "id": "150180311",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "谢谢你的好意，不过等等…你接受得这么快，我反而有点愧疚…呃，没关系吗？会不会耽误你本来要做的事？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150180312"
            ]
          },
          "150180312": {
            "id": "150180312",
            "speakerId": 10205,
            "speakerName": "？？？",
            "text": "没关系没关系，我本来是到这边训练的，正好打算收拾东西回家，我们也算顺路。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150180313"
            ]
          },
          "150180313": {
            "id": "150180313",
            "speakerId": 10205,
            "speakerName": "？？？",
            "text": "而且我来当向导的话，你们会了解更多这里的风土人情，收获很多新知识，就会很开心对吧！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150180314"
            ]
          },
          "150180314": {
            "id": "150180314",
            "speakerId": 10205,
            "speakerName": "？？？",
            "text": "你们开心的话，我就会开心。阿卡特叔叔说，这叫「待客之道」。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150180315"
            ]
          },
          "150180315": {
            "id": "150180315",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "好、好吧…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150180316"
            ]
          },
          "150180316": {
            "id": "150180316",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "感觉是个单纯又热情的人呢。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150180317"
            ]
          },
          "150180317": {
            "id": "150180317",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "运气挺好的。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150180318"
            ]
          },
          "150180318": {
            "id": "150180318",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "是吧，我也这样觉得，我喜欢她！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150180319"
            ]
          },
          "150180319": {
            "id": "150180319",
            "speakerId": 10205,
            "speakerName": "？？？",
            "text": "怎么啦，如果准备好了的话，我们就出发吧。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150180320"
            ]
          },
          "150180320": {
            "id": "150180320",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "对了，还没有问你叫什么名字呢。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150180321"
            ]
          },
          "150180321": {
            "id": "150180321",
            "speakerId": 1098,
            "speakerName": "瓦雷莎",
            "text": "对哦，我叫瓦雷莎，很高兴认识你们！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1501804",
      "subQuestName": "继续前进",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "150180401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "150180401": {
            "id": "150180401",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "你好，请问…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150180403"
            ]
          },
          "150180403": {
            "id": "150180403",
            "speakerId": 10205,
            "speakerName": "？？？",
            "text": "嗯？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150180404"
            ]
          },
          "150180404": {
            "id": "150180404",
            "speakerId": 10205,
            "speakerName": "？？？",
            "text": "#你们…难道就是派蒙和{NICKNAME}？！终于等到你们了！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150180405"
            ]
          },
          "150180405": {
            "id": "150180405",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "哇啊！你认识我们？原来我们名声已经这么响了啊。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150180406"
            ]
          },
          "150180406": {
            "id": "150180406",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "不过…我们来「沃陆之邦」这件事难道和谁说过吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150180407"
            ]
          },
          "150180407": {
            "id": "150180407",
            "speakerId": 10205,
            "speakerName": "？？？",
            "text": "欸，你们不知道？伊安珊老师和我说邀请你们来「沃陆之邦」做客，所以我很早就在这里边训练边等了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150180408"
            ]
          },
          "150180408": {
            "id": "150180408",
            "speakerId": 10205,
            "speakerName": "？？？",
            "text": "你们真的来了…嘿嘿，居然真的来了，太好了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150180409"
            ]
          },
          "150180409": {
            "id": "150180409",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "也、也不用这么激动吧？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150180410"
            ]
          },
          "150180410": {
            "id": "150180410",
            "speakerId": 10205,
            "speakerName": "？？？",
            "text": "你们可是对抗深渊的英雄啊，事迹已经传遍纳塔了，我听了好几遍「杜麦{RUBY#[S]希望}尼」的故事，印象深刻！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150180411"
            ]
          },
          "150180411": {
            "id": "150180411",
            "speakerId": 1098,
            "speakerName": "瓦雷莎",
            "text": "从伊安珊老师说你们可能会来「沃陆之邦」开始，我就特别期待！哦，对了，我叫瓦雷莎，伊安珊老师应该提过我的名字吧？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150180412"
            ]
          },
          "150180412": {
            "id": "150180412",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "啊，我有印象！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150180413"
            ]
          },
          "150180413": {
            "id": "150180413",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "那个时候深渊打进来，我们问伊安珊需不需要回「沃陆之邦」支援，她说瓦雷莎已经把那边的威胁解决了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150180416"
            ]
          },
          "150180416": {
            "id": "150180416",
            "speakerId": 1098,
            "speakerName": "瓦雷莎",
            "text": "没有啦，还是阿卡特叔叔指挥得好，我只是清理了一些魔物而已。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150180417"
            ]
          },
          "150180417": {
            "id": "150180417",
            "speakerId": 1098,
            "speakerName": "瓦雷莎",
            "text": "想想那时候发生的事，还是觉得有点后怕呢…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150180418"
            ]
          },
          "150180418": {
            "id": "150180418",
            "speakerId": 1098,
            "speakerName": "瓦雷莎",
            "text": "不过现在这些已经结束了，「沃陆之邦」受到的影响比较小，重建也已经完成，我们部族的人最近都在到处支援。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150180419"
            ]
          },
          "150180419": {
            "id": "150180419",
            "speakerId": 1098,
            "speakerName": "瓦雷莎",
            "text": "嘿嘿，就让我带你们去部族的营地看看吧。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150180420"
            ]
          },
          "150180420": {
            "id": "150180420",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "好啊，这就出发吧！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1501806",
      "subQuestName": "继续前进，抵达「沃陆之邦」",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1501807",
      "subQuestName": "与瓦雷莎交谈",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "150180801"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "150180801": {
            "id": "150180801",
            "speakerId": 1098,
            "speakerName": "瓦雷莎",
            "text": "我们终于到了，这里就是「沃陆之邦」的部族营地，也就是我的家。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150180814"
            ]
          },
          "150180814": {
            "id": "150180814",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "哇啊，好壮观，那个牛头形状的高台真气派，我很喜欢！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150180802"
            ]
          },
          "150180802": {
            "id": "150180802",
            "speakerId": 1098,
            "speakerName": "瓦雷莎",
            "text": "嘿嘿，那个叫「逐响擂台」，是我们举办各种比赛的地方。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150180803"
            ]
          },
          "150180803": {
            "id": "150180803",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "谢谢你带我们来。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150180804"
            ]
          },
          "150180804": {
            "id": "150180804",
            "speakerId": 1098,
            "speakerName": "瓦雷莎",
            "text": "不客气不客气，小事一桩。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150180815"
            ]
          },
          "150180815": {
            "id": "150180815",
            "speakerId": 1098,
            "speakerName": "瓦雷莎",
            "text": "我很想带你们在这里好好转一圈，但是我要先回家一趟。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150180816"
            ]
          },
          "150180816": {
            "id": "150180816",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "想起什么重要的事了吗？刚刚丘丘人出现的时候，就感觉你好像很着急…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150180817"
            ]
          },
          "150180817": {
            "id": "150180817",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "希望没耽误你。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150180818"
            ]
          },
          "150180818": {
            "id": "150180818",
            "speakerId": 1098,
            "speakerName": "瓦雷莎",
            "text": "不耽误不耽误，时间上正正好好！不过这件事确实挺重要，训练后最重要的事就是——吃饭！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150180805"
            ]
          },
          "150180805": {
            "id": "150180805",
            "speakerId": 1098,
            "speakerName": "瓦雷莎",
            "text": "饿了肚子，就会有气无力，头晕目眩，精神涣散，胡思乱想，可谓是坏处多多，一定要警惕。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150180806"
            ]
          },
          "150180806": {
            "id": "150180806",
            "speakerId": 1098,
            "speakerName": "瓦雷莎",
            "text": "实在抱歉，我必须首先，立刻，马上吃饭！你们也快去吃饭吧——",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150180807"
            ]
          },
          "150180807": {
            "id": "150180807",
            "speakerId": 1098,
            "speakerName": "瓦雷莎",
            "text": "之后我们「逐响擂台」再见，我先走一步！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150180808"
            ]
          },
          "150180808": {
            "id": "150180808",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "瓦雷莎走掉了…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150180809"
            ]
          },
          "150180809": {
            "id": "150180809",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "怎么说呢，真是个神奇的人，有时候软绵绵的，有时候又横冲直撞…",
